WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.890
ONGOING EARTHQUAKES
TAKE PRECAUTIONS AND GET PREPARED

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:03.890
<i>This marks the fifth earthquake
in the past two days.</i>

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.190
<i>The epicenter is nine kilometers
northwest of Bayron City.</i>

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:07.860
Behold.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:12.190
<i>The intensity of this magnitude 4.8 quake
in various locations are as follows...</i>

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:12.190
Now is that time
where push comes to shove.

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:04.220
EPISODE 10
HIGH HOPES FOR THE WORST CASE

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:04.220
You're finally here. I grew tired of waiting.

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:06.810
What's with how you dress,
you corrupt nun?

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:08.690
Of course I'd get lazy.

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:11.650
I finally escaped from prison,
only to be locked up again.

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:15.320
I simply chose a place where
police surveillance won't bother you!

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:17.650
In either case,
now that they know your face...

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:21.490
there's nowhere you can hide in this City.

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.370
It's best for you
to quietly spend your time here.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.750
Then, is it time to check my answers?

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:32.630
Speak up about the memories
you saw, demon.

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:44.850
So, that incident literally was a trap
set up by a demon.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:47.980
So, Mr. Isamu wasn't the cause.

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:50.100
It really was just like Shu believed!

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:50.980
Y-Yeah.

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:54.770
<i>Incident? Incident...</i>

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:57.990
<i>That's right. Dad died. Twelve years ago.</i>

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.320
<i>Why? A trap set up by a demon?</i>

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:02.950
<i>What does that mean?</i>

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:08.080
Why did that demon abduct just Kanna?

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:12.330
Was it the doing of someone who'd known
about the Ogata family from before that?

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:16.090
I don't know the true identity
or the objective.

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:19.590
It wasn't in Miles's...
the Demonically Possessed's memories, either.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:23.550
I think he probably wasn't told
about why, either.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.100
There are other questions.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:28.600
Why did Miles save just Shu?

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:31.640
He abandoned Shu's parents
and had his little sister be abducted.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:34.270
I'm not interested in that case.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.770
This is more important.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:40.360
The proof of a contract with Asmodeus.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:42.990
This guy isn't Demonically Possessed.

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:46.740
He doesn't gain power from contracts.
He's the one who provides the power.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:52.210
So, that's the demon that killed
Mr. Isamu and abducted Kanna.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:55.920
The Celestial Abbey has been after it
for quite some time now.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:58.920
A different era, a different location...

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:00.670
a different face...

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:02.680
This thing has appeared multiple times...

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:07.180
created countless Demonically Possessed
and brought chaos into the world.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:11.680
But there was one thing
they had in common...

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:12.940
and that is...

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:17.190
So, for over a hundred years,

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:20.360
Asmodeus has shown up
all over the globe,

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:24.530
and it just happened to arrive
at Bayron City 12 years ago?

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:28.330
And because Asmodeus arrived,

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:32.120
the Demonically Possessed
began to infest Bayron City?

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.870
You reversed the order.

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:38.750
It arrived in this city
after the horde of demons appeared...

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:41.920
guided by Orgonium.

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:49.310
I see. Mr. Isamu Ogata had been citing that theory
12 years ago when he headed over to the mine.

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:52.520
And that's why Asmodeus targeted him.

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:56.900
For them, Isamu was the demon
that was ravaging their paradise.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:05:00.150
In any case, Kisara,
the key to solving this mystery...

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:03.690
is in that location
you saw in those memories.

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:06.530
Hive Three Mine.

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:08.820
That's quite a nostalgic name.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.740
But that mine supposedly...

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:15.250
has completely submerged underwater
because of the incident 12 years ago?

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.000
Let's investigate again.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:21.250
Perhaps there's some kind
of clue left behind.

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:26.260
Don't worry, Shu!

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:28.720
We'll make sure to find Kanna!

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:31.470
Yeah, thank you so much.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.560
Um...

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:34.810
Ayano!

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:37.480
I'm always counting on you!

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:03.380
I didn't think you'd be offering me a deal.

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:07.130
Is it all right to go against the will
of your master?

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:10.140
I will rescue Shu's little sister.

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:14.640
I can't show him any more harsh truths.

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:16.890
Did you bring that particular item?

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:45.920
And... what's this urgent matter?

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:48.670
I have a budget committee
late this afternoon—

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.050
What's this?

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:52.140
It's from this morning.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:55.930
The location where Hive Three Mine
supposedly existed.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:59.020
The site of that Demon Hazard 12 years ago.

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.440
What did you do?

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:03.150
Those waters are completely off-limits
ever since the incident—

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:05.940
Yes. The government prohibited
investigation onsite...

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.900
with the reason that they wanted
to prevent a secondary disaster.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.700
But if so, what the hell is that?

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:15.450
So, that place used to be a mine?

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:17.370
An Orgonium vein?

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:20.160
No matter how I look at it,
it's nothing but a sandy ocean bottom.

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.500
I don't see traces of such activity at all.

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:25.880
I'll cut to the chase, Linfa.

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:31.010
Where is the actual Hive Three Mine
located right now?

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:36.930
These are the locations where Demon Hazards
have been caused by Asmodeus

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:40.890
that the Celestial Abbey has collected
over the past few centuries.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.520
It's... that emblem.

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:48.900
This is a giant magical circle
drawn by Asmodeus all over Europe.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:50.440
What's this?

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:53.110
The location of the final ritual.

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:56.450
Every last person disappeared
from the village that was located here...

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:00.450
and Asmodeus disappeared
afterwards, as well.

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:06.880
And now, the locations of the Demon Hazards
in this City that you brought me...

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:09.510
The same emblem!

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:14.130
Just imagining what it's trying to do
is going to be fun, isn't it?

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:15.430
But... But wait!

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:21.140
If that's the case, the location where the final ritual
is going to be held is... in the middle of the ocean?

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:25.440
That's where we need to head to.
It's gone far away from the City now...

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:28.570
but it's Hive Three Mine
in the present day.

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:33.320
No way! There's no way that
an ocean floor mineral vein can relocate—

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:35.450
Right.

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:40.910
The City Government made
a foolish move 12 years ago.

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:42.750
ACCIDENT - ROAD CLOSED

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:44.620
SPEED ZONE AHEAD

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:44.620
ROAD CLOSED
ALL DAY

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:47.630
SPEED ZONE

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:48.630
After that Demon Hazard...

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:48.630
ROAD CLOSED

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:52.630
the government completely
shut down Hive Three Mine.

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:58.350
They wanted to hide what happened there
back then and what exists there today.

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:01.180
I'm telling you, we were taking into consideration
the safety of our citizens—

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:04.600
But merely shutting it down
didn't put your mind at ease.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:07.900
That's why you went through
with one extra plan.

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:11.900
You moved it away from the City. No...

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:13.610
it's the other way around.

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:16.070
The City itself is a Mega-Float,

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:19.240
so you shifted it far away
from Hive Three Mine.

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:23.160
Just how much of this did you know?

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:26.710
You knew about this, and you were still
comfortable pretending to be my friend?

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:29.170
I wasn't pretending.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:34.090
Well, it doesn't really matter anymore
whether you're my friend or not.

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:37.590
There's only one thing I wanna ask.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:44.430
Where's the location where Shu's father died
and Kanna went missing 12 years ago?

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:48.850
So, you're choosing a man
over friendship, huh?

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:50.520
Shu...

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:51.980
No...

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:54.360
I don't have any time left!

00:09:54.990 --> 00:10:00.990
That case wasn't handed down to me from
Grandfather Yoshiteru who was mayor at the time—

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:02.450
What's wrong?

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:18.010
You betrayed me, Linfa?

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:21.220
It's clear that they're targeting me
along with everything else!

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:25.140
I see.

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:28.730
So it was disguised
as Shu's mother in this city.

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:32.650
It took Shu's little sister...

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:35.990
probably because
she really was its daughter.

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:42.490
And it didn't take Shu with it
because he wasn't its real son, huh?

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:47.750
The Celestial Abbey last confirmed
Asmodeus's existence 16 years ago.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:51.380
Its whereabouts had been
completely unknown ever since.

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:53.290
Sixteen years ago...

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:57.550
It likely switched places
with Shu's real mother around that time...

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:00.090
to deceive all of us.

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:06.060
It even fooled Shu's father
and gave birth to Shu's little sister?

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:09.520
The child between a demon
that walked among human society

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:11.730
and the most powerful Exorcist.

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:13.650
Why would it do such a thing?

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:17.440
There's always been
only one objective for Asmodeus.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:18.860
And that is?

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:24.740
A world where humans and demons
are hand in hand, living together in harmony.

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:31.960
Ayano Yugiri!

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:35.960
Release the deputy mayor
and surrender immediately!

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:38.510
You don't need to surrender, you know!

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:41.300
I can shoot to my heart's content
for the first time in a while!

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:42.720
Give it up, Ayano!

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:45.680
We're here with direct orders
from the government!

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:49.930
<i>We have seized AAA HQ,
and your mother is in our custody!</i>

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:54.020
If you resist any further,
even we won't be able to cover for you!

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:58.480
<i>Big Sister, are you all right?</i>

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:00.900
Thanks to you, I almost wasn't all right!

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:04.870
This is abduction of a leading government
official, a dangerous act of terrorism.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:08.740
<i>I can't help it if my rescue mission
ends up being a little rough.</i>

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:10.960
I was simply out on a drive with a friend!

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:12.920
Why did you have
such a misunderstanding?

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:14.460
Linfa...

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:18.880
Calling in a horde of demons into this world?

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:23.340
And to do that, it created a child between
human and demon, the most suitable gate.

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:28.600
That means it's going to use Shu's sister
as a gate to summon demons here...

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.230
from somewhere else?

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:35.940
There you have it. Don't you think
your ilk should all be eradicated?

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:43.780
But in the end, that objective of Asmodeus
still hasn't been fulfilled.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:48.330
Not only that, but it hasn't appeared
anywhere in our world for the past 12 years.

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:54.080
Every Demon Hazard since
had been controlled by that agent.

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:56.960
It disappeared from our world?

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:59.090
The possibility is high.

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:03.720
That may have been
the final achievement by Shu's father.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:10.600
But now, that state of equilibrium
is about to be broken.

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:14.520
The numerous Demon Hazards caused
by Miles were all for opening the gate

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:16.850
that is Shu's little sister...

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:22.610
and calling Asmodeus back to this world
along with countless demons?

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:27.110
That's why we must find Shu's little sister...

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.450
before the government...

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:32.830
and before Shu.

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:37.670
<i>It's a pity, AAA.</i>

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:41.340
<i>First, you make a troll bid in an auction,
then you rebel against the government.</i>

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:45.220
It really was a mistake
to leave this up to Ayano.

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:48.010
If it were me,
I would've abducted you instead.

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:51.140
<i>In any case, it's game over.</i>

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:53.470
<i>Calmly get out of that car...</i>

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.180
<i>Ayano Yugiri.</i>

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:02.860
Ayano!

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:14.160
- Huh?
- Huh?

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:19.500
That's...

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.090
Shu!

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:26.380
Shu Ogata! You, too?

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:29.090
<i>There you go, your ride is here.</i>

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:30.300
<i>Go, Ayano.</i>

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:33.310
<i>I don't see Kisara or that nun.</i>

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:36.020
<i>It's likely that every second counts now.</i>

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:38.560
B-But, Mom, Shu's current state is...

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:43.020
<i>It's true that his memory
is getting pretty hazy now.</i>

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:45.900
<i>But I don't think he'd forget how to fight.</i>

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:49.700
<i>Because that's one thing
that I engraved as muscle memory</i>

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.490
<i>and not as a memory in his brain.</i>

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:53.700
Shu Ogata! Damn you!

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:58.250
<i>So, did you properly obtain
the top secret government info?</i>

00:14:58.250 --> 00:14:59.250
Oh...

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:03.210
A small deserted island to the northwest.

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:05.210
I sent you the positional data.

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:08.300
Thank you, Linfa!

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.510
You really are my best friend ever!

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:12.850
Like I can believe that after all this.

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:22.690
Let's go, Ayano!

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:24.360
To where Kisara is!

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.710
Prepare to launch. Hurry.

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:43.540
W-Will you really use that...

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:49.420
The revival of Asmodeus is something
that must be prevented at all costs.

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:51.180
H-However...

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:54.090
If we deal with it now,
the civilians will remain unharmed!

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:59.730
The only ones that will die are demons
and humans from outside this city.

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:04.860
What do you intend to do?

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:10.240
There's no doubt about it.

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:12.400
The location that was in Miles's memory.

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:15.410
A satellite weapon?

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.990
A relic of the Cold War.

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:22.040
I bought it from the mafia after a certain
nation's government sold it off to them.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:26.880
Would something of that nature
from the previous century really function?

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:32.260
And even if it does, that's totally
a violation of the Heavy Weapons Act.

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:40.640
She's really here.

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:58.780
What's the meaning of this?

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:03.330
You say that, but it seems you were
fully predicting this would happen.

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:06.080
I won't let you kill her!

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:10.460
I believe I politely taught you
just how dangerous of an existence she was.

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:15.800
But still, she's the only family left for Shu!

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:17.510
No.

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:21.720
Including me, she's one
of two family members he's got left!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:25.100
The Heavy Weapons Act aside,

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:28.980
Miss Kisara is absolutely essential
for peacekeeping within the City!

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:32.030
You must know that
better than anyone else!

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:36.570
But at this rate, we'll be unleashing
a horde of demons into this world.

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:40.740
The ace up our sleeve for peacekeeping
of this City will be destroying it!

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:45.330
At the least, do talk it out with her.
Mr. Ogata's group is headed onsite, as well.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:49.960
Please somehow think of a solution
that everyone can be satisfied with—

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:52.340
Chief... It's already too late.

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:31.960
No way!

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:33.840
Kisara!

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:43.470
What's the meaning of this?
It's not working at all!

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:46.600
After all, it is a product
from 50 years ago.

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:52.860
What... is that?

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:05.950
Asmodeus...

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:07.960
Is that thing really...

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:22.340
Kisara!

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:45.280
Ayano...

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:47.290
Take the controls.

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:48.910
What are you planning on doing?

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:17.820
You've got quite the taste
for things, Asmodeus.

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:23.660
You really...

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:26.530
have the worst hobby ever!

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:38.170
Kisara!

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:12.200
Shu...

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:17.920
Let go of Kisara,

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:19.840
damn demon!

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:28.140
Kisara!

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:29.510
Are you all right?

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:30.600
Hey!

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:34.350
Shu... You don't even...

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:36.900
your mom...

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:39.980
We're gonna defeat it.

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:44.950
This is the final battle.

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:46.450
Take...

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:49.160
every last memory I have left.

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:53.870
Kisara?

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:55.750
No! I can't!

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:58.250
Any more than this, and Shu...

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:00.290
You won't be yourself anymore!

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:09.550
Kisara?

00:22:09.850 --> 00:22:11.100
Kisara!

00:23:55.620 --> 00:24:00.040
EPISODE 11
GENTLE FOOLISH LIES

00:23:56.700 --> 00:23:59.160
"Gentle Foolish Lies."
